# Tasks: routing index

Forward-looking task state and the historical lesson record.

## Files

- [[todo]]: forward-only. Active in-flight work, open loops, parked backlog. As tasks ship, the block moves to [[journal]] with the outcome.
- [[lessons]]: historical record of every lesson learned. Flat chronological by `## YYYY-MM-DD` headers. Search by date or topic when you need the rationale behind a rule.
- [[journal]]: completed Active blocks and session reviews. Historical record of what shipped.

## Companion at vault root

- [[Rules-of-Engagement]]: the active operational rules distilled from `lessons.md`. This is the session-start read. `lessons.md` is the full story; ROE is what to do.

## Rules

- **Lessons format**: `## YYYY-MM-DD` header, then `### Rule: <headline>` entries underneath. Add the active form to `Rules-of-Engagement.md` at the same time.
- **todo.md is forward-only.** When a task ships, move the entire block to `journal.md` with the outcome. Do not let `todo.md` accumulate completed items.
- **Open loops live here**, not in scattered project notes.

